# ---------------- HighTemplar.events (Task 27 Part F example) ----------------
# The caster half of Task 27: click-to-target, caster-free area damage and a shared cooldown.
#
# WHAT IT SHOWS
#   · `aim "psi storm" at a point` arms the pick; the next left click on the ground resolves it
#     (escape / right click cancels and refunds nothing, so the cooldown still starts)
#   · `when my aim picks a target` runs on the caster's own sheet, and `my aim` is the point
#   · `damage area around my aim` needs no projectile and never destroys the caster; every
#     actor in the radius takes the hit — 30 fire, so a unit wearing `my FireResist 50` loses
#     half — then armour, shields and health, plus a real "damage" message for its effects
#   · `my "psi storm" cooldown` is the shared timer, so nothing has to poll for it
#
# SETUP (editor): an EventSheet on the caster, Event File = `HighTemplar`, a `PsiStorm`
# particle effect under the actor (or the `play particle` warns once and carries on), and the
# `psi storm` / `gunshot` clips the sound names look for. An optional `AimMarker` actor in the
# scene follows the cursor while aiming.
#
# Task 19 Part C is where the 3D movement and the rest of the caster's kit land.
bind StormLabel to my "psi storm" cooldown

when me appears
  set my unit type to "land"
  set my attack type to "ranged"
  set my attack range to 250
  set my MaxHealth to 40
  set my Health to 40
  set my Mana to 100
  set my StormCost to 75

when Q is pressed
  my "psi storm" is ready
  my Mana is higher than my StormCost
  deduct my StormCost from my Mana
  aim "psi storm" at a point
  put "psi storm" on cooldown for 15 seconds

# The storm lands where the player clicked. `my aim` is the pick point whether the click hit
# bare ground or a unit, so the same line covers both; 180 is the storm's radius in cm.
when my aim picks a target
  damage area around my aim by 30 fire for radius 180
  play particle "PsiStorm"
  play sound "psi storm"
  set my StormCasts to my StormCasts + 1

when my Health becomes 0
  destroy me
